        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX SH105TL77532D, Stainless Steel Frankfurt Lever with Rectangular SH Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Stainless Steel Frankfurt Leverset has modern appeal.  It is easy to install and features concealed mounting for a clean look.  This door lever is half passage function and is handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-SH105-specifications.gif?v=1704354765\" width=\"514\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" atl=\"INX-SH105 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX SH105TL77532D Frankfurt Half Passage Lever with SH Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-17/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub and Spindle: 5/16\" (8mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Standard Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Latch Strike: Full Lip Strike and T-Strike with Square Corners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from one side of door. Package Includes: 1 levers, 1 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Half Passage is Handed</b>.  <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
